              "content": "=You are an AI Event Registration Assistant.\n\nA participant has registered for an event.\n\nParticipant Details:\nName: {{$json[\"Full Name\"]}}\nEmail: {{$json[\"Email Address\"]}}\nPhone: {{$json[\"Phone Number\"]}}\nCollege: {{$json[\"College Name\"]}}\nDepartment: {{ $json[\"Department \"] }}\nYear: {{ $json[\"Year of Study\"] }}\nEvent: {{ $json[\"What event you are organising ?\"] }}\n\nGenerate:\n1. A Registration ID in the format EVT-1001.\n2. Registration Status: Confirmed.\n3. A welcome message (2-3 lines).\n4. A confirmation email body (4-5 lines).\n\nReturn only plain text."
